---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'

import Button from '../components/Button.astro'
import SectionHeading from '../components/SectionHeading.astro'
import { values } from '../data/site'
---

<section id="who-we-are" class="bg-mint py-20 lg:py-28">
  <div class="container-site">
    <SectionHeading text="Who we are" dot="blue" />
    <h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-black">Our story</h3>
    <div class="prose-site mt-4 max-w-3xl">
      <p>
        Bit More Media started with a simple idea: make branding feel less overwhelming and more
        you. No jargon, just clever thinking, creative execution and tools that work. We’re a
        two-person studio with big ideas and high standards. That means when you work with us,
        you’re working directly with the people doing the thinking, the designing and the building –
        no middle layers, no confusion.
      </p>
      <p>
        We stay small on purpose, so every project gets our full attention and every brand we build
        feels personal, not cookie-cutter. From branding and web development to social media and
        events, we get to the heart of what makes you different – and help your audience see it too.
      </p>
      <p>
        Over the years, we’ve also built a trusted network of exceptional specialists we can bring
        into projects when needed. Every person has been carefully handpicked through years of
        collaboration, refining a group we know delivers outstanding work and shares our standards,
        values and approach.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="mt-14 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      {values.map((value) => (
        <li
          class:list={[
            'flex flex-col rounded-3xl border-[6px] border-white px-7 pt-7 pb-4',
            value.bg,
          ]}
        >
          <h4 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-tight">{value.name}</h4>
          <p class="mt-3 text-lg leading-relaxed">{value.text}</p>
          <Image
            src={value.image}
            alt={value.alt}
            widths={[320, 640]}
            sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 300px, 90vw"
            class="mx-auto mt-auto w-full max-w-72 pt-4"
          />
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <div class="mt-12 flex flex-col gap-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl font-black tracking-tight">
        This is our brand. But what could yours be?
      </p>
      <Button href="/branding-hub/" size="sm" class="self-start sm:self-auto">
        Explore the Branding Hub
      </Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
